CORE
Test
--function Test.getClassThenForName -cp `../../../../scripts/format_classpath.sh target/classes ../../../lib/java-models-library/target/core-models.jar ../../../lib/java-models-library/target/cprover-api.jar`
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
Object.getClass must return the same java.lang.Class object as
Class.forName, also for classes whose class literal the program does not
refer to, irrespective of which of the two is called first. JBMC obtains the
Class object of such a class from cproverGetClassObject of the model of
java.lang.Class on the first call of getClass for that class.
